d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/503130fa02add59c5ca2f8e72430f0b372ee3ecb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T13:00:38Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T13:00:38Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化 freeze() 中的索引计算\n\n由于索引是连续分配的，可以直接使用 names.len() 而不是\n遍历 HashMap 找最大值。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d7e5538d1adaf7e90da6de2a7a7ee212abc6a36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/4d7e5538d1adaf7e90da6de2a7a7ee212abc6a36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/503130fa02add59c5ca2f8e72430f0b372ee3ecb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/503130fa02add59c5ca2f8e72430f0b372ee3ecb","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDUwMzEzMGZhMDJhZGQ1OWM1Y2EyZjhlNzI0MzBmMGIzNzJlZTNlY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/753e70bcff4ddd9f168cd8c2014670e017bfe3af","sha":"753e70bcff4ddd9f168cd8c2014670e017bfe3af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/753e70bcff4ddd9f168cd8c2014670e017bfe3af"}],"sha":"503130fa02add59c5ca2f8e72430f0b372ee3ecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/503130fa02add59c5ca2f8e72430f0b372ee3ecb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/753e70bcff4ddd9f168cd8c2014670e017bfe3af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T12:56:51Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T12:56:51Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化闭包创建性能，closure-create 提升 41%\n\n主要优化：\n1. BytecodeFunction.bytecode 从 Box<Bytecode> 改为 Rc<Bytecode>\n   - 避免每次创建闭包时克隆整个字节码\n   - 现在只需要 Rc::clone() 增加引用计数\n\n2. 添加 Env::freeze_global_only() 快速路径\n   - 当闭包不需要捕获局部变量时，只共享全局帧\n   - 避免遍历和处理所有帧\n\n3. 添加 Env::define_batch() 批量定义方法\n   - 预分配容量，减少内存分配次数\n   - 跳过不必要的检查\n\n4. 优化 LocalSlots::all_bindings() 单帧快速路径\n   - 当只有一个帧时，跳过 HashMap 去重\n   - 直接构建 Vec 返回\n\n性能提升：\n- closure-create: 12.10ms -> 7.16ms (提升 41%)\n- closure-call: 1.38ms -> 1.42ms (基本持平)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b99ed893c954042ec7ab9b5bda241d451fcd7290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/b99ed893c954042ec7ab9b5bda241d451fcd7290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/753e70bcff4ddd9f168cd8c2014670e017bfe3af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_