mments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T12:29:01Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T12:29:01Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"test: 添加闭包性能测试\n\n为 Xu、Python 和 Node.js 添加两个闭包性能测试：\n- closure-create: 测试创建 N 个闭包并立即调用\n- closure-call: 测试创建一个闭包并调用 N 次\n\n更新 py_node_report.py 的 case_order 以包含新测试。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9467212677f698b25d8feef7333908b76e71c573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/9467212677f698b25d8feef7333908b76e71c573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/af2d61c6ea187053181526b451297efe097ececd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/af2d61c6ea187053181526b451297efe097ececd","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKGFmMmQ2MWM2ZWExODcwNTMxODE1MjZiNDUxMjk3ZWZlMDk3ZWNlY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/e6d4d735a01eedd5e14db37b023703f5b09a7d2e","sha":"e6d4d735a01eedd5e14db37b023703f5b09a7d2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/e6d4d735a01eedd5e14db37b023703f5b09a7d2e"}],"sha":"af2d61c6ea187053181526b451297efe097ececd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/af2d61c6ea187053181526b451297efe097ececd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/e6d4d735a01eedd5e14db37b023703f5b09a7d2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T12:24:23Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T12:24:23Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix: 修复lambda闭包无法捕获外部函数参数的bug\n\n问题：当函数返回lambda时，lambda内部无法访问函数的参数。\n\n根本原因：\n- op_make_function中创建lambda时，freeze()返回的Env与原Env共享Scope\n- 随后调用pop()会清除detached帧的scope内容\n- 这导致lambda的捕获环境被意外清空\n\n修复：\n- 添加Env::pop_without_clear()方法，弹出帧但不清除scope\n- op_make_function中使用pop_without_clear()替代pop()\n- 类型检查器中跳过actual为any类型的赋值检查\n- 递归收集嵌套函数签名以支持类型推断\n\n新增测试：\n- tests/specs/closure/lambda_capture_param.xu\n- tests/specs/closure/nested_func_lambda.xu\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3cf562aacd0676e64b74c741c24bf4178a6b1aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/b3cf562aacd0676e64b74c741c24bf4178a6b1aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/e6d4d735a01eedd5e14db37b023703f5b09a7d2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/e6d4d735a01eedd5e14db37b023703f5b09a7d2e","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKGU2ZDRkNzM1YTAxZWVkZDVlMTRkYjM3YjAyMzcwM2Y1YjA5YTdkMmU","parents":[{"htm