/api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/2d987b4569343311f9991b357a64096f537d4e98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T10:05:38Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T10:05:38Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"refactor: 清理技术债务，提取dict哈希计算公共函数\n\n- 新建 dict_helpers.rs 模块，提取 compute_map_hash 和 update_hot_key_cache 函数\n- 消除 6 处重复的哈希计算代码\n- 简化 DictInsertCacheLast 结构体，删除未使用的 map_index 和 dict_ver 字段\n- 删除重复的测试文件 (v1_1_drafts/)\n- 删除引用不存在文件的测试 (perf_vm_vs_ast.rs)\n- 修复所有 clippy lint 警告\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f083b176ce4a4b92c5392d6f642a89baf1ca2749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/f083b176ce4a4b92c5392d6f642a89baf1ca2749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/2d987b4569343311f9991b357a64096f537d4e98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almana