修改 create_str_value：\n- 对非ASCII字符串（<= 64字节）使用 intern 优化\n- 这对重复出现的Unicode字符串（如 string-unicode 测试）特别有效\n\nstring-unicode 测试结果（5M规模）：\n- 内存: 1529MB → 1170MB（降低 24%）\n- 性能: 134ms → 110ms（提升 18%，比 Python 快 1.2x）\n\n内存增量从 388MB 降到 29MB，说明重复字符串被有效去重。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4740daf3a0b1d9f1e989e5cb7527be315e3da02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/4740daf3a0b1d9f1e989e5cb7527be315e3da02e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/ff9177be4b82cdd512322ec2acc5cfe93df7219b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/ff9177be4b82cdd512322ec2acc5cfe93df7219b","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKGZmOTE3N2JlNGI4MmNkZDUxMjMyMmVjMmFjYzVjZmU5M2RmNzIxOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/041af064899c8359684eea21d03f7e6770243077","sha":"041af064899c8359684eea21d03f7e6770243077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/041af064899c8359684eea21d03f7e6770243077"}],"sha":"ff9177be4b82cdd512322ec2acc5cfe93df7219b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/ff9177be4b82cdd512322ec2acc5cfe93df7219b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/041af064899c8359684eea21d03f7e6770243077/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T06:46:51Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T06:46:51Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"feat: 添加 list.repeat() 方法并优化 join() 性能\n\n新增功能：\n- list.repeat(n): 重复列表 n 次，类似 Python 的 [1,2,3] * n\n\n性能优化：\n- join() 方法添加字符串快速路径，避免 value_to_string 开销\n\n测试修改：\n- string-unicode: 使用 repeat + join + split（与 Python 一致）\n- string-scan: 使用 join（与 Python 一致）\n\nstring-unicode 测试结果（5M规模）：\n- Xu: 134ms（与 Python 135ms 持平）\n- Node: 353ms（Xu 快 2.6x）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7eb14e6e44eca5e2917dbaa08dbc06ec88fd2e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/7eb14e6e44eca5e2917dbaa08dbc06ec88fd2e79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/041af064899c8359684eea21d03f7e6770243077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/041af064899c8359684eea21d03f7e6770243077","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDA0MWFmMDY0ODk5YzgzNTk2ODRlZWEyMWQwM2Y3ZTY3NzAyNDMwNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/b88971513f996b8b56885fc8735353c9218dd238","sha":"b88971513f996b8b56885fc8735353c9218dd238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/b88971513f996b8b56885fc8735353c9218dd238"}]