-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/35a5fec78440df0b7e3ac37b61b5de3c47fdb73c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T06:14:24Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T06:14:24Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化dict整数键性能，dict-intkey提升5.3x\n\n将 ELEMENTS_MAX 从 4096 提高到 8M，让更多整数键使用 O(1) 数组查找\n而不是 HashMap 查找。内存按需分配，不会浪费空间。\n\ndict-intkey 测试结果（5M规模）：\n- 性能: 752ms → 142ms（提升 5.3x，比 Python 快 1.95x）\n- 内存: 986MB → 640MB（降低 35%，比 Python 少 20%）\n\n其他测试无明显影响。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b070eff048e9214901791f59074d191904ebe41c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/b070eff048e9214901791f59074d191904ebe41c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/35a5fec78440df0b7e3ac37b61b5de3c47fdb73c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git