r_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/b970799677cb1e529c1e7a89790c2f57697937f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T06:01:35Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T06:01:35Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化GC内存管理，峰值内存降低47%\n\n主要改动：\n- 降低初始GC阈值：50万→10万对象，256MB→128MB\n- 添加动态阈值上限：最大50万对象/256MB，防止无限增长\n- 限制string_value_intern缓存大小为10万条目\n- GC时同步清理string_value_intern缓存\n\n内存优化效果（5M规模测试）：\n- 峰值内存：2294MB → 1222MB（-47%）\n- 内存累积问题已解决\n\n性能变化：\n- string/string-builder: -15%/-29%（提升）\n- struct-method/list-push-pop: -12%/-7%（提升）\n- dict/dict-miss: +33%/+106%（回归，但仍优于Python/Node）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a0353951a07a7ed73f6222a8dbb932cb927cb96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/8a0353951a07a7ed73f6222a8dbb932cb927cb96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/b970799677cb1e529c1e7a89790c2f57697937f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.co