s://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/58111a72e8a5582095d01e3224f073f3167240ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T05:11:46Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T05:11:46Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix: 修复块作用域变量释放和GC truncate问题\n\n1. 块作用域修复:\n   - 添加 in_function 标志区分函数内部和顶层代码\n   - 顶层块使用 EnvPush/EnvPop 管理作用域\n   - 修复 resolve_local() 在顶层块不使用 local 变量\n   - 修复 compile_foreach() 在顶层块不使用 local 变量\n   - 修复 env.pop() 清除分离帧的 scope.values\n\n2. GC truncate 修复:\n   - 添加 free_slot_count() 方法\n   - 当碎片化严重时清除 small_int_strings 和 bytecode_string_cache\n   - 执行第二次 GC 以回收缓存的字符串\n   - 优化 free_list 构建顺序，优先使用低 ID\n\n3. 调试改进:\n   - memory_stats() 增加 len/cap/last_live 信息\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea3400c35429a7a5717e84ff16847a1390a9ce73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/ea3400c35429a7a5717e84ff16847a1390a9ce73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/58111a72e8a5582095d01e3224f073f3167240ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/58111a72e8a5582095d01e3224f073f3167240ea","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDU4MTExYTcyZThhNTU4MjA5NWQwMWUzMjI0ZjA3M2YzMTY3MjQwZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/68a8568c86722022f32bbcf3fe98faf808747f43","sha":"68a8568c86722022f32bbcf3fe98faf808747f43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/68a8568c86722022f32bbcf3fe98faf808747f43"}],"sha":"58111a72e8a5582095d01e3224f073f3167240ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/58111a72e8a5582095d01e3224f073f3167240ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/68a8568c86722022f32bbcf3fe98faf808747f43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T03:57:31Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T03:57:31Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化 split() 内存使用和 intern 策略\n\n- 优化 split() 实现，避免中间 Vec<String> 分配\n- 修改 intern 策略：只对 <=2 字节的字符串使用 intern\n- 对于唯一字符串（如数字序列），避免 intern 缓存开销\n\n性能提升：\n- split 内存：从 139 字节/字符串降到 75 字节/字符串\n- string 测试：从 529ms 降到 330ms（比 Python 快 27%）\n- string 测试内存：从 2740MB 降到 2294MB\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38bef0fda72c6066047ab8b3a727023bb50eb4bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/38bef0fda72c6066047ab8b3a727023bb50eb4bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/68a8568c86722022f32bbcf3fe98faf808747f43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgD