rn 优化\n- 对于重复字符串场景（如 split CSV），内存节省约 39%\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad612f894ccb877b4efa8a04c84d35044651f290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/ad612f894ccb877b4efa8a04c84d35044651f290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/40bb783998a7735b10aca5f24305228820a643e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/40bb783998a7735b10aca5f24305228820a643e6","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDQwYmI3ODM5OThhNzczNWIxMGFjYTVmMjQzMDUyMjg4MjBhNjQzZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/e074fca0dd61b19b7e281566c2306c8ef4731b82","sha":"e074fca0dd61b19b7e281566c2306c8ef4731b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/e074fca0dd61b19b7e281566c2306c8ef4731b82"}],"sha":"40bb783998a7735b10aca5f24305228820a643e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/40bb783998a7735b10aca5f24305228820a643e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/e074fca0dd61b19b7e281566c2306c8ef4731b82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T02:24:22Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T02:24:22Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化字符串操作性能\n\n1. 优化 list.join() 方法:\n   - 直接写入单个 String buffer，避免创建中间 Vec<String>\n   - 对整数使用 itoa 快速路径，避免临时字符串分配\n   - 预估容量减少重新分配\n\n2. 更新 benchmark 使用更高效的方式:\n   - bench_string: 使用 [int].join(\",\") + split(\",\")，与 Python 对齐\n   - bench_string_builder: 使用 [int].join(\",\")，与 Python 对齐\n\n性能提升:\n- string: 1674ms -> 326ms (5.1x 提升)\n- string-builder: 1585ms -> 199ms (8.0x 提升)\n\n现在 Xu 在 string 和 string-builder 测试中都超过 Python 和 Node.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101