优化Dict内存布局 - 延迟分配elements和prop_values\n\n将DictInstance的elements和prop_values字段从Vec<Value>改为\nOption<Box<Vec<Value>>>，实现延迟分配策略：\n\n- 不使用整数键的dict不再分配elements数组\n- 不使用Shape的dict不再分配prop_values数组\n- 每个不使用这些特性的dict可节省约48字节\n\n主要修改：\n- value.rs: 修改DictInstance结构，添加辅助方法\n- heap.rs: 更新size()计算和GC标记逻辑\n- dict.rs, access.rs等: 更新所有elements/prop_values访问\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"365499ac3babc54d4260543ec382c0a1cbb4cec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/365499ac3babc54d4260543ec382c0a1cbb4cec9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/4ebee8ba8e9aacd64e4c05cb2ce4c53c3670145e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/4ebee8ba8e9aacd64e4c05cb2ce4c53c3670145e","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDRlYmVlOGJhOGU5YWFjZDY0ZT