","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/da8d899dc88d5d1685378c8bc7cda9cb237b1a93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T18:00:49Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T18:00:49Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"feat: 实现分代GC基础设施\n\n- 新增 GenerationalHeap 结构，支持 young/old 代划分\n- 实现 write_barrier 写屏障机制（card marking）\n- 添加 track_alloc 追踪新分配对象\n- 在 Runtime 中集成 gen_heap（通过 generational-gc feature 启用）\n- 将所有 heap.get_mut() 调用替换为 heap_get_mut() 以支持写屏障\n- 优化 Heap.sweep() 内存回收策略\n- 添加 collect_refs 和 free_objects 方法支持 young GC\n\n当前状态：\n- 分代GC基础设施已完成\n- Young GC 暂时禁用（性能开销需进一步优化）\n- 性能与原版GC基本一致\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20894b811c5504278ad444d9e910f306bc56da79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/20894b811c5504278ad444d9e910f306bc56da79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/da8d899dc88d