owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/781c80be9d097a1d9275a4a9cdf0afa0ac4bcb06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T10:09:08Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T10:09:08Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 深度优化Dict实现 - 使用ObjectId引用代替字符串复制\n\n核心改动：\n- DictKey从复制字符串改为存储ObjectId引用（StrRef变体）\n- 字符串key只存储hash和obj_id，不复制字符串内容\n- DictKey大小从32字节减少到16字节\n- 更新GC标记阶段，标记Dict的key引用的字符串\n\n性能提升（10M规模）：\n- dict测试：20036ms -> 3309ms（6倍提升）\n- 现在比Python还快（Python: 4651ms）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude (claude-opus-4-5-20251101-thinking) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7409b7bd7bd024706f67fa7f69f6cad81286cc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/e7409b7bd7bd024706f67fa7f69f6cad81286cc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/781c80be9d097a1d9275a4a9cdf0afa0ac4bcb06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/781c80be9d097a1d9275a4a9cdf0afa0ac4bcb06","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDc4MWM4MGJlOWQwOTdhMWQ5Mjc1YTRhOWNkZjBhZmEwYWM0YmNiMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/fea1cefb6ffbb3c778a8a9e4b46424a7c1418840","sha":"fea1cefb6ffbb3c778a8a9e4b46424a7c1418840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/fea1cefb6ffbb3c778a8a9e4b46424a7c1418840"}],"sha":"781c80be9d097a1d9275a4a9cdf0afa0ac4bcb06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/781c80be9d097a1d9275a4a9cdf0afa0ac4bcb06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/fea1cefb6ffbb3c778a8a9e4b46424a7c1418840/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T08:44:29Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T08:44:29Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf: 优化GC和内存管理\n\n主要改进：\n1. 使用mimalloc替代系统allocator，更好地将内存返回给OS\n2. 优化GC：清理object pools避免内存泄漏\n3. 扩大小整数字符串缓存到1000万\n4. 提高GC阈值减少GC频率\n5. 优化builder_finalize使用move而非clone\n6. 添加concat_int_str和concat_str_int快速路径\n7. 优化dict insert使用预计算hash\n8. 移除dict lookup中无用的缓存更新\n\n性能改进（500万基数）：\n- string-builder: 1032ms -> 235ms (4.4x更快)\n- string: 1099ms -> 394ms (2.8x更快)\n- dict-miss: 596ms -> 299ms (2.0x更快)\n- 内存使用从939MB降到254MB\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e0a96d464db08b27114efe10af5e66b94f7a6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/2e0a96d464db08b27114efe10af5e66b94f7a6be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/fea1cefb6ffbb3c778a8a9e4b46424a7c1418840","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu