s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-05T17:28:24Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-05T17:28:24Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix: 修复 clippy lint 警告并优化代码\n\n- 移除 xu_runtime/src/lib.rs 中大部分全局 #![allow(...)] 指令\n- 修复 clone_on_copy: 对 Copy 类型使用 * 而非 .clone()\n- 修复 map_or -> is_some_and/is_none_or 更惯用的写法\n- 修复 unwrap_or_else -> unwrap_or_default\n- 修复 hash_one 替代手动创建 hasher\n- 修复 first() 替代 get(0)\n- 修复 copied() 替代 cloned() 用于 Copy 类型\n- 修复 &[T] 替代 &Vec<T> 用于函数参数\n- 修复 if_same_then_else: 合并相同分支\n- 修复多余的类型转换 (as i64, as u64, .into())\n- 修复 length comparison to one\n- 保留 DictKey::eq 的显式短路返回以保持性能\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf512f46e8d7d03974f13a4a0d902a9441ae6581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/bf512f46e8d7d03974f13a4a0d902a9441ae6581"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/110ba2e43eff1bbdf035b8ce0c7d92317111c3ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti