arabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/5863ef80cb45818641a945a65b14d7d90d04eade/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T20:55:34Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T20:55:34Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"feat: 支持冒号语句中用分号分隔多语句\n\n冒号后的内联语句现在支持用分号分隔多个语句：\n\n    if x > 0: a = 1; b = 2; print(\"done\")\n    for i in list: sum += i; count += 1\n    while n > 0: process(); n -= 1\n\n规则：\n- 分号分隔同一内联块中的多个语句\n- 换行结束内联块\n- 嵌套时，分号后的语句属于最内层控制结构\n- 分号后可以换行继续（不限于单行）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d3b65eddcd8269ab50104b8c0aa0096ac028e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/6d3b65eddcd8269ab50104b8c0aa0096ac028e83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/5863ef80cb45818641a945a65b14d7d90d04eade","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/follow