anassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/b6ef39d2f9ac82c399e17b8d5559910af85e48ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T17:20:05Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T17:20:05Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"refactor: 统一内置类型的属性和方法访问\n\n- List/Dict/String: length 同时支持属性(.length)和方法(.length())\n- List: 添加 first() 方法，删除 .first 属性\n- Tuple: 只支持 .length 属性和 length() 方法，删除 .len 简写\n- Option: 保留 .has 属性和 has() 方法，删除 .none/.value 属性和 none()/unwrap() 方法，保留 get() 方法\n- Enum: 保留 .name/.type_name 属性和 name()/type_name()/to_string() 方法\n- 更新语言规范文档和数据类型清单文档\n- 更新所有示例和测试文件以使用新的 API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"563ac4771f9fffd710c94636a35beea07350f24a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/563ac4771f9fffd710c94636a35beea07350f24a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/b6ef39d2f9ac82c399e17b8d5559910af85e48ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com