bi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/76d4047eef0d2457e56d7567be2e644ecb3e6061/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T16:04:43Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T16:04:43Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix: 修复快速路径中字符串比较的 bug\n\n在 run_bytecode_fast_params_only 中，Eq/Ne 操作使用 a.bin_op()\n直接比较 Value 的内部 u64 值，对于字符串只比较对象 ID 而不是\n字符串内容，导致相同内容的不同字符串对象比较结果为 false。\n\n修复方案：对于 Eq/Ne 操作，使用 rt.values_equal() 进行正确的\n值比较，与正常路径 (op_eq/op_ne) 保持一致。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9073105bf9ea6fff4cbcf3dd1a359489f06b6e6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/9073105bf9ea6fff4cbcf3dd1a359489f06b6e6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/76d4047eef0d2457e56d7567be2e644ecb3e6061","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":