ple.com","name":"local"},"message":"refactor: 闭包语法改为 |x| expr 格式\n\n将闭包语法从 func(x) -> expr 改为 |x| expr 格式：\n- 单表达式: |x| x + 1\n- 块形式: |x| { return x + 1 } 或 |x| -> T { ... }\n- 空参数: || expr\n\n修改内容：\n- 解析器添加 parse_closure_expr 和 parse_empty_closure_expr\n- 移除旧的 parse_func_lit_expr\n- 更新所有示例、测试和文档\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b5f8275d76c57de47d9a403ce96945502a5da91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/5b5f8275d76c57de47d9a403ce96945502a5da91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/68c40b80ba1fd179fa15c65b9a3d43a0b578a3fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/68c40b80ba1fd179fa15c65b9a3d43a0b578a3fd","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDY4YzQwYjgwYmExZmQxNzlmYTE1YzY1YjlhM2Q0M2EwYjU3OGEzZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com