bscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/d4c014ad9ddcb0f01e23046111ab2d889d842cd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T12:15:24Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T12:15:24Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix: 修复字典获取结构体字段访问及添加 Option/List 方法\n\n1. 修复从字典获取结构体后访问字段失败的问题\n   - 在 Compiler 中添加 known_types 集合跟踪已定义的类型名\n   - compile_expr_member() 只对已知类型名使用 GetStaticField\n   - 同步修复 compile_assign() 中的静态字段赋值逻辑\n\n2. 添加 Option.get()/unwrap() 方法\n   - 新增 OptGet 方法类型\n   - 支持 TAG_OPTION (Option#some) 和 TAG_ENUM (Option#none) 两种表示\n   - Some 返回内部值，None 抛出错误\n\n3. 添加 list.find_or(predicate, default) 方法\n   - 新增 ListFindOr 方法类型\n   - 找到匹配元素返回该元素，否则返回默认值\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ab3601ecf0542b5decbf0ed67b3454a4892697b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/7ab3601ecf0542b5decbf0ed67b3454a4892697b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/d4c014ad9ddcb0f01e23046111ab2d889d842cd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/receive