omments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/527c77de51f02f77d07f561b17a7eaea1a08a366/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T11:25:58Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T11:25:58Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"refactor: Runtime 结构重组与内存管理优化\n\n主要变更:\n1. Runtime 结构重组\n   - 新增 TypeSystem 管理类型系统（结构体、枚举、静态字段）\n   - 新增 CacheManager 管理缓存（方法缓存、IC 槽、字符串池）\n   - 新增 ObjectPools 管理对象池（环境池、VM 栈池、小列表池）\n\n2. 内存管理优化\n   - 添加小列表对象池 (small_list_pool)，复用容量 ≤8 的列表\n   - GC 检查间隔从 128 改为 1024 条指令，减少检查开销\n   - heap.rs 添加 #[inline] 优化 should_gc()\n\n3. 测试修复\n   - perf_runtime_exec.rs: 修复语法问题，使用 Driver 编译\n   - perf_benchmarks.rs: 支持解析 JSON 格式输出\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a54384352a5d2f601b5e5d08c25a30ce6772825e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/a54384352a5d2f601b5e5d08c25a30ce6772825e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/527c77de51f02f77d07f561b17a7eaea1a08a366","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/