etIntConst, DictInsertStrConst (3个)\n  用 Const/ConstInt + GetIndex/DictInsert 替代\n\n总操作数从 64 个减少到 51 个，简化编译器和运行时代码。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e924db54d843ba85b323022d255ad371a073b08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/9e924db54d843ba85b323022d255ad371a073b08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/f4e6048a25f359d7f3bbf95f24149862073f5297","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/f4e6048a25f359d7f3bbf95f24149862073f5297","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKGY0ZTYwNDhhMjVmMzU5ZDdmM2JiZjk1ZjI0MTQ5ODYyMDczZjUyOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/0ebaa695e9ec36f3fba886b3c9dcc7f4114c1236","sha":"0ebaa695e9ec36f3fba886b3c9dcc7f4114c1236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/0ebaa695e9ec36f