000000\n2. 优化 builder_push 避免字符串克隆 (使用 unsafe 指针)\n3. 优化 op_str_append 使用 Text::concat2 避免克隆\n4. 优化 DictInsert 字符串键路径避免创建 DictKey\n\n性能改进 (scale=500000):\n- string-builder: 从 86.29ms 降到 24.23ms (-71%)\n- string: 从 82.01ms 降到 25.20ms (-69%)\n- dict-miss: 从 103.68ms 降到 43.57ms (-58%)\n- dict: 从 236.92ms 降到 168.36ms (-29%)\n\n当前状态: 10/14 场景超过 Python\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d10ff5fc656f79ee769f8cd0950d739f31feb656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/d10ff5fc656f79ee769f8cd0950d739f31feb656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/b1a6836ed2a5549445cccd38957aad7aba1700a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/b1a6836ed2a5549445cccd38957aad7aba1700a1","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKGIxYTY4MzZlZDJhNTU0OTQ0NWNjY2QzODk1N2FhZDdhYmEx