lear() 方法以清空 elements 和 prop_values 数组\n\n性能改进 (scale=10000):\n- dict-intkey: 从崩溃修复到比 Python 快 1.4x\n- loop: 比 Python 快 5.7x，比 Node.js 快 1.7x\n- string: 比 Python 快 1.7x，比 Node.js 快 1.4x\n- dict-miss: 比 Python 快 1.2x，比 Node.js 快 2x\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47ea22985b8d67a32d5878d830afc24e00c2c125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/47ea22985b8d67a32d5878d830afc24e00c2c125"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/dc2bfcda2fa62f497206b30844e1a054fc30da68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/dc2bfcda2fa62f497206b30844e1a054fc30da68","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKGRjMmJmY2RhMmZhNjJmNDk3MjA2YjMwODQ0ZTFhMDU0ZmMzMGRhNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/0884bd099a6d2114e5d818cd8bcc49ce3799bc47","sha"