ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/1ced3e7f001b248f7497b725f04c43a0b66348f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T14:51:08Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T14:51:08Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"perf(runtime): 优化字典操作和添加测试 golden 文件\n\n字典操作优化:\n- 扩展整数键快速路径 ELEMENTS_MAX 从 1024 到 65536\n- 优化 DictGet 方法，先检查缓存再计算 hash，减少 key 克隆\n- 优化 DictGetInt 使用 elements 数组快速路径\n- 优化 OptHas 使用 raw_entry API 避免创建 DictKey\n- 移除 DictCacheLast 中不再需要的 key_hash 字段\n\nText 类型增强:\n- 添加 try_push_str_in_place 等方法支持原地修改\n- 添加 is_unique 方法检查唯一所有权\n\n测试和工具:\n- 添加缺失的 golden 文件 (examples 和 integration 测试)\n- 修复 py_node_report.py 进度输出，添加 flush=True\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"691f2ae667c1a7ff776190aae165f841edfc8fdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/691f2ae667c1a7ff776190aae165f841edfc8fdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/1ced3e7f001b248f7497b725f04c43a0b66348f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/1ced3e7f001b248f7497b725f04c43a0b66348f4","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDFjZWQzZTdmMDAxYjI0OGY3NDk3YjcyNWYwNGM0M2EwYjY2MzQ4ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966","sha":"54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966"}],"sha":"1ced3e7f001b248f7497b725f04c43a0b66348f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/1ced3e7f001b248f7497b725f04c43a0b66348f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T12:23:12Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T12:23:12Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix(analyzer): 修复 for 循环变量 slot 分配不一致问题\n\n问题：当多个 for 循环使用相同的变量名时，静态分析器会为每个循环\n分配新的 slot，但运行时只有一个 slot。这导致后续循环中的变量\n访问使用错误的 slot，返回 void 值。\n\n解决方案：在静态分析器中，如果变量名已经存在于 scope 中，复用\n现有的 slot 而不是分配新的 slot。\n\n同时添加了字典的点号成员访问支持（dict.field 等同于 dict[\"field\"]）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc6dc33937297e8030a2728ee7ed4e92aad915a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/bc6dc33937297e8030a2728ee7ed4e92aad915a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDU0NzkyYTcxYTk4NDRhNzM0ZDRhNjkwZjJlM2NhMjM1MWJlMjc5NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/0598918a44d0394c4d5b98b7ff27fe13b9e6265c","sha":"0598918a44d0394c4d5b98b7ff27fe13b9e6265c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/0598918a44d0394c4d5b98b7ff27fe13b9e6265c"}],"sha":"54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/54792a71a9844a734d4a690f2e3ca2351be27966"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/commits/0598918a44d0394c4d5b98b7ff27fe13b9e6265c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T11:35:39Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T11:35:39Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix(runtime): 修复跨函数作用域的变量查找问题\n\n问题：在方法体内引用全局变量（如 println）时，静态分析设置的 slot\n值是相对于词法作用域的，但运行时的 locals 栈是相对于调用栈的，\n导致 slot 查找返回错误的值（如调用者栈帧中的 void）。\n\n解决方案：\n- 在 Runtime 中添加 func_entry_frame_depth 字段，记录函数入口时的帧深度\n- 在变量查找时，计算当前函数内的有效帧深度范围\n- 只有当 slot 的 depth 在有效范围内时才使用 slot 查找\n- 超出范围的变量引用（如全局变量）fallback 到 env 查找\n\n这个修复同时保证了：\n1. 方法体内的全局变量（如 println）能正确通过 env 查找\n2. match/if/while 等语句中的嵌套作用域变量能正确通过 slot 查找\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd9bcbaa922fd13140deee39173b2f76165791f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/fd9bcbaa922fd13140deee39173b2f76165791f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/0598918a44d0394c4d5b98b7ff27fe13b9e6265c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: