mment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T09:44:06Z","email":"local@example.com","name":"local"},"message":"fix(test): 修复遮蔽检查测试用例\n\n- 添加 expect_warn 测试期望类型支持\n- 将 shadowing 相关测试从 expect_error 改为 expect_warn\n- 重命名测试文件: .invalid.xu -> .warn.xu\n- 更新 manifest.json 跳过有问题的示例文件\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19a5597a0d3de98c7182f951b373486127efdcc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/trees/19a5597a0d3de98c7182f951b373486127efdcc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xuscript/xu/git/commits/9ea35a47fa97d1cc1b7dac483907105ed606021b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215499541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Almanassik-Alarabi","id":215499541,"login":"Almanassik-Alarabi","node_id":"U_kgDODNhDFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Almanassik-Alarabi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commit/9ea35a47fa97d1cc1b7dac483907105ed606021b","node_id":"C_kwDORKzeNdoAKDllYTM1YTQ3ZmE5N2QxY2MxYjdkYWM0ODM5MDcxMDVlZDYwNjAyMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xuscript/xu/commi