":"Pedro Mello"},"message":"feat: implementa aplicação de livraria online com micro frontends\n\n- Configura monorepo Turborepo com pnpm workspaces\n- Cria pacotes compartilhados: types, utils, ui (design system), store (Redux)\n- Implementa backend API em Express com autenticação e catálogo de livros\n- Cria aplicação web com listagem de livros, busca e filtros por categoria\n- Adiciona sistema de favoritos (prateleira)\n- Implementa header com autenticação e acesso aos favoritos\n- Cria modal de detalhes do livro com informações completas\n- Traduz todo conteúdo para português brasileiro","tree":{"sha":"e644ee7fcea78a4a3f483e90e0bccd02b6292683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicatriz-dev/micro-frontends-course/git/trees/e644ee7fcea78a4a3f483e90e0bccd02b6292683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicatriz-dev/micro-frontends-course/git/commits/1478178e969592165abdff694e182cd52e956546","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16566846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cicatrizdev","id":16566846,"login":"cicatrizdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTY2ODQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicatrizdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_