16:13Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:16:13Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(ops): mint lcm enrolment tokens from the console\n\nGateway operators can mint single-use lcm enrolment (join) tokens for\nservices of this trust domain — the console equivalent of\n`authsvc mint-enrollment-token`:\n\n- POST /gateway/v1/ops/enrollment-tokens (operators only) takes service\n  names or SPIFFE ids (spiffe://<td>/svc/<name>), an optional tenant\n  (default: the lcm mesh tenant) and a lifetime of 1-30 min (auth caps\n  enrolment tokens at 30 min), and calls auth''s MintEnrollmentToken. The\n  token is returned once (no-store), never stored or logged; the mint is\n  audited as enrollment_token_minted without it.\n- Shell: Gateway operations > Enrolment tokens shows the token once with\n  a copy button. Gateway operations is now a menu with its four pages\n  (Allow-list and Audit were reachable only by URL).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e65dee6ff0eefed33ca0ebfd4f4932ec802ca3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/6e65dee6ff0eefed33ca0ebfd4f4932ec802ca3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/adb36ae682652272b868d7e7bc58b694a7216eff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organiz