nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/f9411c0991a0f31029ee9bca01dfaf347f5ee05e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:22:59Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:22:59Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(shell): keep active users signed in; send ended sessions to sign-in\n\n- Session keeper: while the person is active (input, scrolling, the tab\n  becoming visible) the session is renewed at most every 5 min through\n  POST /api/v1/session/refresh; tabs share the deadlines in localStorage.\n  Two minutes before the idle deadline a dialog offers to stay signed in;\n  at the deadline the session is signed out and the browser goes to\n  sign-in, back to the same page afterwards.\n- Expiry watcher: any 401 (the shell''s or a module remote''s, via the\n  kit''s onUnauthenticated) or a dropped live stream checks\n  /gateway/v1/me; only a confirmed loss redirects to\n  /console/signin?next=<page>.\n\nNeeds @go-tangra/ui 4.4.0 (onUnauthenticated).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa4c7d05454ef90e7ce7d65c0ec1083eb2146971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/fa4c7d05454ef90e7ce7d65c0ec1083eb2146971"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/f9411c0991a0f31029ee9bca01dfaf347f5ee05e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4",