url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/82abc149b94c2aa4ab16e8bdfb76c502ff4d027d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:27:36Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:27:36Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(authz): decide permissions per module (019)\n\nThe gateway names the route''s module on every decision\n(PermissionRef.module) so the same resource:action of two modules are\ndifferent permissions. The decision cache key gains the module\n(gwdec:<t>:<u>:<module>:<res:act>@<ver>); /me/modules navigation and\n/me/abilities CASL rules qualify the manifest''s bare requires with the\nregistration''s module, so a permission held for one module no longer\nunlocks another module''s navigation, rules, routes or methods. Refs\nwithout a module or with a qualified permission are refused unasked.\n\nSyncPermissions registers on each module''s behalf with module and\nmodule_display_name and never sends roles, role sets or built-in\ngrants; a refused registration is logged per module and the others\nstill register.\n\nAuth SDK sdk/v4.1.0.","tree":{"sha":"b27822e42942858c91326655b88ac9f02d40d186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/b27822e42942858c91326655b88ac9f02d40d186"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/82abc149b94c2aa4ab16e8bdfb76c502ff4d027d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned