":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/7dc4b280f3ce134e36a0146da9add848a3636a70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:47:36Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:19:54Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(enroll): verify lcm''s SVID on the gateway''s first enrollment\n\nThe gateway enrolls directly at lcm''s keyless listener, which presents lcm''s\nSVID (URI SAN only, mesh root). Public verification cannot pass, so the\ngateway ran with enroll.insecure: true, also in production.\n\nenroll now embeds the framework''s config.EnrollTLS: enroll.ca_file (mesh\ntrust bundle) and enroll.server_spiffe_id (default\nspiffe://<trust_domain>/svc/lcm) verify the server chain and SPIFFE ID\nthrough tlsconf.LoadEnrollClientConfig, passed to lcmidentity.NetConfig.\nEnrollTLS. enroll.insecure is warned and refused in production; with\nenroll.enabled, enroll_url must be https and lcm_grpc and token_file are\nrequired.\n\nRequires go-tangra v4.1.0 and go-tangra-lcm sdk/v4.1.0; go.mod still names\nv4.0.0 and is bumped once both are tagged (build locally with a go.work).","tree":{"sha":"101d151d8b757d88baa6e440b07ea6f03ab7ea94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/101d151d8b757d88baa6e440b07ea6f03ab7ea94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/7dc4b2