url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/3976b4ce1148b754e87a9c6cbc2971ba3f9291c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:22:48Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:22:48Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"refactor: go-tangra v4 module paths, public test helpers and SDK modules\n\nPrepare the monorepo for the split into per-service go-tangra repositories:\n- module paths: github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra/v4 (platform),\n  go-tangra-<service>/v4 (auth -> go-tangra-auth, gateway -> go-tangra-portal),\n  contrib/<x>/v4 and <service>/sdk/v4\n- internal/testrt and internal/testutil move to the public freyatest package,\n  since services in other repositories cannot import internal packages\n- nested sdk modules for auth, gateway, lcm, warden, inventory and ipam hold\n  the protos and clients other services use, breaking the auth/gateway/lcm\n  module cycle\n- a go.work replaces the per-module replace directives; go.mod files require\n  v4.0.0 and use go 1.26.3; ipam now requires the warden sdk","tree":{"sha":"6cec48c09ee9d15b1a3bd67914cbd94fab2a6d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-po