owers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/2025c243aba9ef6dea88dd181dfb9c077a131aa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:22:47Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:22:47Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"refactor(ui): publishable @go-tangra/ui 4.0.0 kit\n\nRename @freya/ui to @go-tangra/ui 4.0.0 (GitHub Packages) so each front-end can\nlive in its own repository. Front-ends no longer reach into ui/ by relative\npath: ESLint rules come from @go-tangra/ui/eslint, Tailwind sources from\n@go-tangra/ui/sources.css, and the legacy check from the\ngo-tangra-ui-check-no-legacy bin. Module-federation singletons use the new\nname. The packed kit contains only dist, CSS, rules and bins.","tree":{"sha":"d4c59febc1f044512a00e74287c4f6ae89272c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/d4c59febc1f044512a00e74287c4f6ae89272c8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/2025c243aba9ef6dea88dd181dfb9c077a131aa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commit/2025c243aba9ef6dea88dd181dfb9c077a131aa2","node_id":"C_kwDORK95OtoAKDIwMjVjMjQzYWJhOWVmNmRlYTg4ZGQxODFkZmI5YzA3N2ExMzFhYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commit/8cb9375b6946fcd73549ea6a54f6ba56b7748cb5","sha":"8cb9375b6946fcd73549ea6a54f6ba56b7748cb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/8cb9375b6946fcd73549ea6a54f6ba56b7748cb5"}],"sha":"2025c243aba9ef6dea88dd181dfb9c077a131aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/2025c243aba9ef6dea88dd181dfb9c077a131aa2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/8cb9375b6946fcd73549ea6a54f6ba56b7748cb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T22:10:41Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T22:10:41Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(dns): PowerDNS management plane with IPAM sync and ACME DNS-01 (spec 015)\n\nNew services/dns module replicating go-tangra-dns on Freya: tenant-scoped\nzones and record sets over the PowerDNS HTTP API (globally unique,\nnon-overlapping zone names; record content validated and canonicalised with\nmiekg/dns; compensation on partial failure), zone templates, supermasters\n(platform-admin), BIND export, NOTIFY, recursor forward-zone sync, IPAM\naddress sync (IPv4 + IPv6 A/AAAA + PTR, subnet-sized reverse zones,\npublic-suffix-aware auto zones; events treated as hints and re-read from\nIPAM over mTLS), server configuration rendering with Docker restart limited\nto the two PowerDNS containers (platform-admin, off by default), a curated\nmetrics dashboard, events/SSE, backup export/import, and an @freya/ui remote.\n\nLCM gains a freya-dns ACME DNS-01 provider (own dnschallenge client; dns\naccepts challenge calls from the lcm identity only) and its stream data race\nis fixed. IPAM gains ipamclient.GetAddress plus a policy rule for dns, and\ntwo lint cleanups (ReverseProxy Rewrite, unused store helpers).\n\nStack: pdns-auth + pdns-recursor (loopback 5300/5301), dns-secrets-init,\ndns-token, dns service, optional prometheus profile, dns DB/role/Valkey user,\ngateway allow-list, lcm dns discovery, DOCKER_GID in up.sh.\n\nTests: dns coverage 96.2% (authz/sealed/validate 100%), fuzz tests for names,\nrecord content, config rendering, reverse/forward planning, templates and\nbackup; integration tests against real PowerDNS and an lcm ACME flow against\nPebble validating DNS-01; govulncheck clean. Open: T101 (UI e2e needs an\noperator sign-in).","tree":{"sha":"70e0b6fab4aa1733e8988bde9a879302ab96f722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/70e0b6fab4aa1733e8988bde9a879302ab96f722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/8cb9375b6946fcd73549ea6a54f6ba56b7748cb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commit/8cb9375b6946fcd73549ea6a54f6