il edge (relay token, recipient mailbox -> tenant routing, idempotent\nby message id) turns RFC 822 mail into tickets with attachments in object\nstorage; replies thread back by message-id chain or [#id] reference; agents work\ntickets (status, priority, assignee, history, tags, internal notes) and send\nthreaded SMTP replies; CEL triage rules (cost-limited) tag, assign, set\nstatus/priority or drop new mail; loop-safe auto-acknowledgements; sanitised\nHTML view; events, SSE, dashboard statistics, export/import; gRPC API and\nticketclient for other modules; @freya/ui remote (tickets, rules, tags,\nmailboxes, dashboard).\n\nStack: ticket DB/role, Valkey user, compose services (token, dev relay-token\ninit, ticket on 9955/9956/9957 with Mailpit relay), gateway allow-list, auth\nand warden policy rules. Framework: observe.Metrics.Meter for module metrics.\nEvery module Dockerfile lists the new UI workspace; new kit icons.\n\nTests: coverage 93.2% (authz/sealed/secrets/thread/rules compile 100%), fuzz\ntests for MIME parsing, thread tokens, rule compilation, HTML sanitising and\nbackup import, integration mail-flow test against Mailpit; govulncheck clean.\nOpen: T069 (relay token as a warden secret needs a module platform token) and\nT077 (UI part of the smoke test needs an operator sign-in).","tree":{"sha":"75085ef88599559070a9d2c05605ee6c779e5a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/75085ef88599559070a9d2c05605ee6c779e5a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/commits/564129a12a2ae7287a740557ca94d177682b5476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commit/564129a12a2ae7287a740557ca94d177682b5476","node_id":"C_kwDORK95OtoAKDU2NDEyOWExMmEyYWU3Mjg3YTc0MDU1N2NhOTRkMTc3NjgyYjU0NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commit/5d16f20fdf6b1d93680c5e7abf80dd8d7b208f2f","sha":"5d16f20fdf6b1d93680c5e7abf80dd8d7b208f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/5d16f20fdf6b1d93680c5e7abf80dd8d7b208f2f"}],"sha":"564129a12a2ae7287a740557ca94d177682b5476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/564129a12a2ae7287a740557ca94d177682b5476"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2862013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/menta2k","id":2862013,"login":"menta2k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjIwMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menta2k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/commits/5d16f20fdf6b1d93680c5e7abf80dd8d7b208f2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T05:09:24Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T05:09:24Z","email":"veselin.iordanov@gmail.com","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(ui): FlyonUI frontend rework, IPAM parity and drawer-based forms (spec 013)\n\nReplace Vuetify with the shared @freya/ui kit (FlyonUI 2 / Tailwind 4 / Zod 4)\nacross the gateway shell, the auth console and all eight module remotes.\n\nIPAM reaches feature parity with go-tangra-ipam: group and member CRUD\n(new PUT host-group member route), manual subnets with add-child, subnet\nsplit with dry-run preview (POST /subnets/{id}/split), typed locations with\na rack elevation and device placement, and device create/edit with rack\nfields. Subnet overlap checks are hierarchy-aware. The IPAM UI''s API\ncontract mismatches are fixed (trees, check-IP, suggest, search, stats,\nBMC power/sensors), scans follow their async job, and the device package\n\"Sync\" button no longer erases the package list.\n\nCreate/edit forms and record views across all modules open in right-hand\ndrawers (no page dimming); subnets use a go-tangra-style detail drawer that\ncarries every action. Only yes/no confirmations remain dialogs.\n\nKit: dropdown menus render in the top layer, UiRecordDrawer close-on-save,\nnew icons, and a breakpointSpecificity() Vite plugin so responsive\nutilities win regardless of which remote stylesheet loads last.","tree":{"sha":"05a946da70e6f4cd955881bbda2dfd522dec5f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-portal/git/trees/05a946da70e6f4cd955881bbda2dfd522dec5f44"},"url":"