ove the tests, so the calls inside afterEach\nalready applied to the whole file while emitting a hoisting warning that\nbecomes an error in a future Vitest version.\n\nMove both sets to module scope next to the imports and drop the redundant\ncopies from afterEach. Behaviour is unchanged; apps/desktop now runs\n3157 passed / 5 skipped with no unmock warnings.","tree":{"sha":"a66699aad49b94d6c1286d43ff2b6c70dbf5993e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/a66699aad49b94d6c1286d43ff2b6c70dbf5993e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/d645fb183b7245b90ecc66e488ae9ebd99ad7a18","verification":{"payload":"tree a66699aad49b94d6c1286d43ff2b6c70dbf5993e\nparent c0f52c95cf96e3fd02d4d2b2143b31e7c8268864\nauthor Dan Carter <danielrosscarter@gmail.com> 1791311115 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791311115 +0100\n\ntest(desktop): move nested vi.unmock calls to the top level (#621)\n\nVitest hoists vi.unmock above the tests, so the calls inside afterEach\nalready applied to the whole file while emitting a hoisting warning that\nbecomes an error in a future Vitest version.\n\nMove both sets to module scope next to the imports and drop the redundant\ncopies from afterEach. Behaviour is unchanged; apps/desktop now runs\n3157 passed / 5 skipped with no unmock warnings.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxT0LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADjEQAEZb01Uq8hBNSCLHcvx0n0d2\n1mqy+bw1afmVnif4jRqOeWV52TRlCAyU7/WN/ZK0Cxtq4Y2GOjsKOsuT+FQgEbVE\nbLenMA0LZuhx4UDU8qJdaQPPQbIYr0Ob5a/r7cpMh6X8G4n1m5NpyWGkccvSHEty\nTWmXe3SXpEWX0aNPpgrN7zhf8SgB5Bvrnycs5TOylR3UY95TADWnz1mDENXp1KKR\nEc1L5p+mRRJxCeSi+j+/agKcu9iNh+E/whXfECNJsKJBTsl3SdfrIPeu2As0Y2ef\nwa5sgHs54CJbkQJqWyY3T2imBDGP2pDf0rZ1w2L8j5/6VSLy75MdAfZFaDAcDKSe\nY3g0b58Am4brNW45JBYfOQXkcIXq4F8F+VnvN7sYb3XSmSnljnAR+uH1w0UyxdSB\nCfVmUfqvqi4QT6qDKP1/8eDLkzmyJww0QKBora28OQkO0uZppk+tv7GRZAQvlKSM\n8Oa9MFeL82VVT2Rn2XrMNUHV+XpnIboVCODzIUUiRmJGOyCtsnSWawUWy9SkxVLI\nAiVAJhpy4