/api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/0ab9284152da21a1c26f0640136530e64a41b4f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:59:35Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:59:35Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"message":"docs(openspec): archive seven completed changes and sync their specs\n\nArchives adopt-native-code-mode, rework-autonomous-delivery-and-feedback,\nrework-memory-plugin, rationalise-session-tools, support-mcp-2026-07-28,\nreduce-low-value-unit-tests and localise-live-agent-progress.\n\nTheir delta specs are merged into the main specs, which adds twelve\ncapabilities. Three stale statements are corrected on the way:\n\n- session-tool-surface lists codemode in place of run_code\n- programmatic-tool-calling is JavaScript only\n- nested tool results follow Pi''s shapes, and a failed shell command\n  resolves to a value with its exit code","tree":{"sha":"b1b3c3203a869395a0c5137940a60c48e427ab57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/b1b3c3203a869395a0c5137940a60c48e427ab57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/0ab9284152da21a1c26f0640136530e64a41b4f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyt