ers/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/481e6c9608c464aa4c449476504225764524d0e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:28:16Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"Dan Carter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:28:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(memory): wait for the background conversion before session cleanup (#607)\n\n`session_start` starts the one-time MEMORY.md conversion in the\nbackground. When the session has no `sero-cli` tool, `session.prompt`\nreturns early and never awaits the snapshot that runs it. The conversion\nwrites its marker and state lock under `state/memory`, so `afterEach`\ncould remove the temporary home while that write was in flight and fail\nwith ENOTEMPTY.\n\nAwait the shared conversion promise in `afterEach` before restoring the\nenvironment and removing the home. 30 repeated runs of the file pass.","tree":{"sha":"efa83a6b35ac37086f4e4d529b050b3b4d14cb11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/efa83a6b35ac37086f4e4d529b050b3b4d14cb11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/481e6c9608c464aa4c449476504225764524d0e9","verification":{"payload":"tree efa83a6b35ac37086f4e4d529b050b3b4d14cb11\nparent b39251bedc697c152c82e649905c4ca4ce27fa38\nauthor Dan Carter <danielrosscarter@gmail.com> 1791142096 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791142096 +0100\n\ntest(memory): wait for the background conversion before session cleanup (#607)\n\n`session_start` starts the one-time MEMORY.md conversion in the\nbackground. When the session has no `sero-cli` tool, `session.prompt`\nreturns early and never awaits the snapshot that runs it. The conversion\nwrites its marker and state lock under `state/memory`, so `afterEach`\ncould remove the temporary home while that write was in flight and fail\nwith ENOTEMPTY.\n\nAwait the shared conversion promise in `afterEach` before restoring the\nenvironment and removing the home. 30 repeated runs of the file pass.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwqjQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEboQABQvzgUgBxV/SnY4lb9mQgjG\nImxuI3CZOtBL7vPtqkx/ccKU4KqiNz7F3jXONnr84v2lkEMoFwdB89osKT3LeSQi\nB2HUIYPYwey80vI/BLBcV1EKVdGg6/qGAn6iRooGsUIwQeXXLUK+FZX4Hi883cYZ\ngNzPAjgTbMLonLoB4o1LZyYomo8DsJJxS3tYFhWr4AZFm3RpCAUzGjarJwrHH4X1\nsRihUn1K+3ovklwe9y2h8cbWgOhgUCnTQDzZqfvxlsvRxzpMI6M6QfsyW8Eh+MVu\nMfIDFHFJtaztLJkqZOR+AQ65Ma3leGSIerx22dyPsBHOi0B9flYvelmq77byo4Zp\nzAgVmsmhdV4dmd2388jnXnxY3YotdUVwarHUVa96S3e0d+ROtZ8BkmmiE2D4iCMQ\n7mRIqqDnO/vwzYRVroCMRgWh7VEa6KxrzJkX2wx/KwhBZBJGkemNNU0Z4dS3Smjc\nhur6M8lD9EeNsnyicue9YwxCB1BYnp8mGRBm6meKPG+ZxyaKIB+7s/QThqIL27hx\nSQO9r3mbJQNnAveRBFJmyhW07oTvMts2WPQOuLPkWK7hcGZTgWB1AXAJBU3vWmar\nPQju73ESpilQ8oMQcZj/REfZSDU1DZ1C8ZihExFpvFOql41XCr/dInWQRmK0x5kD\nIpYN7ZTKvqSc4ABnj/xq\n=kyRT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:28:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers",