docs site references them.\n- Delete MemoryLoggingSettingsCard and its ConfigPanel wiring. Nothing\n  reads sero.memory.logging since memory-logging-settings.ts was removed.\n- Drop the removed `memory-context` precedent from the Orchestrator README\n  and shared/goal-contract.ts. Those were its last two references.\n- Describe the Memory plugin as curated chat memories instead of the\n  removed daily logs, in the plugin catalog and the homepage.","tree":{"sha":"a93a2212a68c071f68e251afc397754c34a8d1f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/a93a2212a68c071f68e251afc397754c34a8d1f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/8a40d56c236f63be781f1031269827372074c2e8","verification":{"payload":"tree a93a2212a68c071f68e251afc397754c34a8d1f0\nparent 9dedc7781a9d2069bca7896be2c1fe4c3804a7ae\nauthor Dan Carter <danielrosscarter@gmail.com> 1791138963 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791138963 +0100\n\nchore(memory): remove leftovers from before the memory plugin rework (#596)\n\nThe memory plugin rework (#575) replaced the earlier cut-down (#572), so\nfour of that change''s edits never reached main and are still valid. Apply\nonly those, and skip the parts the rework made wrong.\n\n- Delete the unused docs images img10.jpg and memory-chat.jpg. Nothing in\n  the docs site references them.\n- Delete MemoryLoggingSettingsCard and its ConfigPanel wiring. Nothing\n  reads sero.memory.logging since memory-logging-settings.ts was removed.\n- Drop the removed `memory-context` precedent from the Orchestrator README\n  and shared/goal-contract.ts. Those were its last two references.\n- Describe the Memory plugin as curated chat memories instead of the\n  removed daily logs, in the plugin catalog and the homepage.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwpyTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9+sQAIOzoa31MlEV8Db78JKRzg63\nks6ZHrjtcW0Te+qd+cGYo59o3KmZOKHGiDOmVe5ynBMlGHPHTcl8ZBxRpyK+NRgS\nZgTHO8H357ylq+fkMr9aCq