ttps://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/8721edc9646840389ca9e51460f1cb58e1cd2ded/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T19:25:54Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"Dan Carter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T19:25:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: migrate to pnpm 12 (#567)\n\n* docs(openspec): propose pnpm 12 migration\n\nPlan for issue #490: contributors may use any pnpm 12 release, while CI and\nthe sero-node container share the exact version in pins.json.\n\nRefs #490\n\n* chore: migrate to pnpm 12\n\nContributors may use any pnpm 12 release: devEngines.packageManager gives\nthe range as guidance only. CI and the sero-node container use the one\nexact version in runtime-tools/pins.json (12.5.1).\n\n- Move security overrides to pnpm-workspace.yaml unchanged, and replace\n  onlyBuiltDependencies with allowBuilds (5 allowed, 18 denied).\n- Pin validator checks every pnpm/action-setup version against pins.json;\n  the updater rewrites those versions instead of root packageManager.\n- Move all CI pnpm setup steps to pnpm/action-setup v6.1.0.\n- Release deploy uses pnpm_config_* variables (pnpm 12 ignores npm_config_*).\n- sero-node links pnpm to the native @pnpm/exe.linux-<arch> binary.\n- Docs state pnpm 12 and warn that Corepack cannot run it yet.\n\nRefs #490\n\n* docs(openspec): record pnpm 12 container check results\n\nRefs #490\n\n* docs(openspec): mark sero-node containers recreated\n\nRefs #490\n\n* fix(release): stage dist in the pnpm 12 deploy bundle\n\npnpm 12 deploy copies only the files `pnpm pack` would include, so the\ngit-ignored dist/ was dropped except the main entry and the packaged app\nfailed with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND for a dist/electron chunk. Copy dist/\ninto the deploy folder after `pnpm deploy`.\n\nRefs #490\n\n* docs(openspec): record pnpm 12 CI results\n\nRefs #490, #568\n\n* docs(openspec): archive migrate-pnpm-12 and add package-manager-pin spec\n\nRefs #490","tree":{"sha":"035f5a5338ef74eb5e4f898b31081f3bcd99ad0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/035f5a5338ef74eb5e4f898b31081f3bcd99ad0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/8721edc9646840389ca9e51460f1cb58e1cd2ded","verification":{"payload":"tree 035f5a5338ef74eb5e4f898b31081f3bcd99ad0d\nparent 3e667b356add74c8aa2ae5d45d80f0d89423bb7c\nauthor Dan Carter <danielrosscarter@gmail.com> 1790450754 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790450754 +0100\n\nchore: migrate to pnpm 12 (#567)\n\n* docs(openspec): propose pnpm 12 migration\n\nPlan for issue #490: contributors may use any pnpm 12 release, while CI and\nthe sero-node container share the exact version in pins.json.\n\nRefs #490\n\n* chore: migrate to pnpm 12\n\nContributors may use any pnpm 12 release: devEngines.packageManager gives\nthe range as guidance only. CI and the sero-node container use the one\nexact version in runtime-tools/pins.json (12.5.1).\n\n- Move security overrides to pnpm-workspace.yaml unchanged, and replace\n  onlyBuiltDependencies with allowBuilds (5 allowed, 18 denied).\n- Pin validator checks every pnpm/action-setup version against pins.json;\n  the updater rewrites those versions instead of root packageManager.\n- Move all CI pnpm setup steps to pnpm/action-setup v6.1.0.\n- Release deploy uses pnpm_config_* variables (pnpm 12 ignores npm_config_*).\n- sero-node links pnpm to the native @pnpm/exe.linux-<arch> binary.\n- Docs state pnpm 12 and warn that Corepack cannot run it yet.\n\nRefs #490\n\n* docs(openspec): record pnpm 12 container check results\n\nRefs #490\n\n* docs(openspec): mark sero-node containers recreated\n\nRefs #490\n\n* fix(release): stage dist in the pnpm 12 deploy bundle\n\npnpm 12 deploy copies only the files `pnpm pack` would include, so the\ngit-ignored dist/ was dropped except the main entry and the packaged app\nfailed with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND for a dist/electron chunk. Copy dist/\ninto the deploy folder after `pnpm deploy`.\n\nRefs #490\n\n* docs(openspec): record pnpm 12 CI results\n\nRefs #490, #568\n\n* docs(openspec): archive migrate-pnpm-12 and add package-manager-pin spec\n\nRefs #490","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquBxCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnWMQACGD/zGn2Ou4PQUyS3GqWqdG\nCA6gjU42PD1OyuxTsHyjsMf0a1KbMH8yqNvhD/Fj8Vq+gZVB0AoltFbiQE0VGnM2\nk60dyshI66V3LMcAEQ1EZ2sCIVeR2qYGZ3QTWjZO6Gt6YzBcDP6tMfuf6JtlAtai\nTQrU80tIj8D/wkM1WllbU9ZX4FwMvDxO9h7z/nNzse0rZCTrc6+GMTI7Jrh7XTsH\nZAj1sIbm/ynmPuWvJudOPKGsw8TonbVY4eQodKj43CkQV59ZsjRiQvp/Y6+3Rhyl\nyDGBT/jVnZ9Jd5OwH91oti3kDy40eKAcd9OKJbrrAyRtaHxNzbkeQ8tCLmnbxhAP\nnn7fl/jkjqhQVYPHje7DdGTtx01vX1wrIRl9SPz2Rj5qQYCo9ZcOcbrvH5S0Zs3Z\nEf/4vv30JfBa6JyEshPOERBHMztK5OvmjWxhX0aMqijKQLmYwqx2W2aZmvhNk6CD\nirh9WKb2REquZw37Y2SwYb+ZqkOrnsqB2Wn4wh7fojN4bWLPTMj4QVlnHLW9I23d\nkdBIS86y7bPTsxIbIIwyrAOmacm5od9h8D0hXLEGtBSCr9KB/1kNjk9p0JEKe8nw\nA0bLLR38+kfHBNPcVLTdrh3wI+wYM6d3L6WgIpL7rrN0zpuGMyfSF/5cwT+U/O8y\ncCsord4ruU1heIOThn8w\n=M5vN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T19:25:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https