old; a bounded fold says\nnothing is known to be waiting.","tree":{"sha":"72c49c6d2b86971a116b27bf5c1b8166608f86ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/72c49c6d2b86971a116b27bf5c1b8166608f86ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/43ba78e811c336e674ba31af049b5ca58b13ed98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero/commit/43ba78e811c336e674ba31af049b5ca58b13ed98","node_id":"C_kwDORLCb39oAKDQzYmE3OGU4MTFjMzM2ZTY3NGJhMzFhZjA0OWI1Y2E1OGIxM2VkOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero/commit/eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b","sha":"eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b"}],"sha":"43ba78e811c336e674ba31af049b5ca58b13ed98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/43ba78e811c336e674ba31af049b5ca58b13ed98"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:11:36Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:11:36Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"message":"fix(architect): answer review round 2\n\nObservation writes are no longer awaited at all: the per-file writer keeps\ntheir order and a read waits behind them, so a hung disk cannot delay the\nwork or withhold its result, and the failure reporter cannot throw.\nStartup and resume hand recovery the record read after the initial run\nwas opened, and do not recover when that repair failed.\n\nInspector: page state is keyed by journal and detail level, a re-read of\nthe same view merges onto loaded history and keeps the furthest cursor,\nthe selector clears the held page, and Load more is disabled until the\nselected view''s own read has landed. Waiting comes from the runtime''s\nwhole-history openWaits, not from the page in view. Model settings read\nthe host tiers on open and keep every control disabled until they arrive.","tree":{"sha":"b0ce1b8d65ff08a80028ef2ee82bd1bda767aaaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/b0ce1b8d65ff08a80028ef2ee82bd1bda767aaaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero/commit/eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b","node_id":"C_kwDORLCb39oAKGViNzNkNDI1OGEwZjFhYTA2ODhhYWFlNGE1YWFiYTAzOWE3MWUzMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero/commit/1eafa0887653d522346422e9f2a9b2f2634877b5","sha":"1eafa0887653d522346422e9f2a9b2f2634877b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/1eafa0887653d522346422e9f2a9b2f2634877b5"}],"sha":"eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/eb73d4258a0f1aa0688aaae4a5aaba039a71e30b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/commits/1eafa0887653d522346422e9f2a9b2f2634877b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:55:08Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:55:08Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"message":"fix(architect): answer review round 1 across runtime, orchestrator and inspector\n\nRuntime: observation writes never gate the work; one writer per journal\nwith bounded tail reads; late usage is charged to the run it was\ndispatched under; resume and startup open a missing initial run; the\nsnapshot keeps a model id with a separator and an explicit thinking off.\n\nOrchestrator: a Room adjustment keeps its project attribution; legacy\nstring decisions migrate to v4; a one-off declaration survives a planner\nclarification; the context shape is checked before a draft is saved and a\nconflicting requestId reuse is refused rather than coalesced.\n\nInspector: an obsolete read never overwrites the selected run; Load more\nappends by sequence and the selection is keyed by sequence; a preference\nwrite no longer re-reads page one; the shared journal is labelled as\nsuch; unmeasured cost reads not measured; a model filter keeps the\ncharges it cannot attribute and says so; only an open wait shows Waiting;\nmodel settings refresh the cached global tiers on open.","tree":{"sha":"a0ed110bf432bc1a99cbcca08c493f9d95ca7a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/trees/a0ed110bf432bc1a99cbcca08c493f9d95ca7a5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero/git/commits/1eafa0887653d522346422e9f2a9b2f2634877b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero/commit/1eafa0887653d522346422e9f2a9b2f2634877b5","node_id":"C_kwDORLCb39oAKDFlYWZhMDg4NzY1M2Q1MjIzNDY0MjJlOWYyYTliMmYyNjM0ODc3YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero/commit/ca987eb9d28ab0c61627a14734b9bf11f872f7e9","sha":"ca987eb9d28ab0c61627a14734b9bf11f872f7e9","u