gam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T07:41:37Z","email":"mantuonweb@hotmail.com","name":"Mantu Nigam"},"message":"feat: Configure Module Federation and add a feature module\n\nThis commit configures Module Federation for the shell and remote apps using `ngx-build-plus` and adds a new feature module to the remote app.\n\n- Replaced `@angular-devkit/build-angular:application` builder with `ngx-build-plus:browser` in `angular.json` for both shell and remote apps.\n- Added `extraWebpackConfig` option to `build` and `serve` targets in `angular.json` for both shell and remote apps.\n- Added `publicHost` option to `serve` target in `angular.json` for the remote app.\n- Added `webpack.config.js` and `webpack.prod.config.js` files for both shell and remote apps to configure Module Federation.\n- Created a new feature module `MyFeatureModule` in the remote app, including a component, routing module, and spec file.\n- Modified `main.ts` in both shell and remote apps to use a bootstrap file.\n- Created `bootstrap.ts` files in both shell and remote apps to bootstrap the application.\n- Added `run:all` script to `package.json` in both shell and remote apps.\n- Added `ngx-build-plus` as a dev dependency to `package.json` in both shell and remote apps.","tree":{"sha":"fa749c837bcebbc6d23de7fa9f8f8f2c915e79ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mantuonweb/Angular-MFEs/git/trees/fa749c837bcebbc6d23de7fa9f8f8f2c915e79ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mantuonweb/Angular-MFEs/git/commits/d4c390ead6116fad143a5e8d6cfa24f63fbc0a5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15135645?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantuonweb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantuonweb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantuonweb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github