","html_url":"https://github.com/slubwama","id":3336745,"login":"slubwama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzY3NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-report-builder/commits/be11618332c92e2d257b3b3f9285983a249246f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:21:24Z","email":"lubwamasamuel3@gmail.com","name":"slubwama1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:59:22Z","email":"lubwamasamuel3@gmail.com","name":"slubwama1"},"message":"Stabilize report design editor: drag, refresh merge, and structure tracking\n\nFix duplicated/unstable nodes in the report design workspace:\n\n- Drop state-mutating rebuildHierarchicalStructure; row order + indent is\n  the single source of truth. groupingParentId (nearest enclosing\n  group-label, supports nesting) is derived by a pure function applied at\n  the updateGroups choke point, deduping row ids on every pass to heal\n  drafts contaminated by earlier refreshes.\n- Scope design row ids per section (sectionUuid__indicatorUuid) with a\n  deterministic fallback instead of crypto.randomUUID, eliminating\n  cross-group React key collisions that rendered as duplicated nodes.\n  Legacy rows are matched by unique non-empty code and upgraded in place.\n- Refresh from Definition now walks existing rows in their current order\n  (moves, indents and nesting survive), drops indicators removed from the\n  section, and anchors net-new indicators next to their source-order\n  sibling already in the design, inheriting its indent. Repeated section\n  refs no longer duplicate whole groups.\n- Drag rework: before/after drop line from cursor position, block moves\n  so dragging a group label carries its children (own-subtree drops are\n  blocked and the indicator suppressed), block-aware up/down arrows, and\n  drag state cleared on all exit paths.\n- Memoize JSON previews (design + page debug panel) so constant dragover\n  re-renders stop re-serializing the whole form.","tree":{"sha":"8d784334ebbe914ecfc937829aa2058bfa78b519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-report-builder/git/trees/8d784334ebbe914ecfc937829aa2058bfa78b519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-report-builder/git/commits/be11618332c92e2d257b3b3f9285983a249246f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3336745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/slubwama","id":3336745,"login":"slubwama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzY3NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/slubwama","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-report-builder/commit/be11618332c92e2d257b3b3f9285983a249246f2","node_id":"C_kwDORLbxyNoAKGJlMTE2MTgzMzJjOTJlMmQyNTdiM2IzZjkyODU5ODNhMjQ5MjQ2ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"ht