o Baselga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T10:44:17Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"message":"feat(preambles): add anti-overengineering guardrails across all 14 agents\n\nUniversal Simplicity Mandate in all 14 preambles — overrides all other\nguidance with 5 laws and self-check.\n\nRole-specific guardrails for 7 key roles:\n- architect: Complexity Budget (max epics/files scaled to PRD size)\n- dev: Anti-Overengineering Protocol (simplest code per AC)\n- code-reviewer: Overengineering Detection (flags single-use abstractions)\n- security-reviewer: Scope Discipline (proportional to PRD context)\n- qa-engineer: Test Scope Discipline (ACs + happy path only)\n- scrum-master: Complexity Guard (max 5 tasks/story, ratio <4:1)\n- product-manager: Scope Guard (\"Is this in the PRD?\")\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b95881779f8b12795fc9ae22d473a8278f3def50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/b95881779f8b12795fc9ae22d473a8278f3def50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/e391118a5251e3973d6e8f21db2287a68af2c44b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.