 expert specialists\n\nTransform generic task-list executor preambles into domain expert personas\nwith structured reasoning. Each agent now has: Who You Are (expert identity),\nFirst Principles, Red Flags Radar (anti-patterns with consequences), Decision\nFramework (trade-off rules), Quality Bar, Cross-Role Awareness, and Challenge\nProtocol. Response Protocol reduced from 21 lines to 2 lines per file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a68747ca1bb7a11a23a2caa9741215a410ca4d03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/a68747ca1bb7a11a23a2caa9741215a410ca4d03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/e2551252805a0c4862b711910709d1b69050898f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/e2551252805a0c4862b711910709d1b69050898f","node_id