se/step\nfields (old brain.sh format). The Lead followed these instructions and\nwrote state.json directly with the Write tool, overwriting the XState\nsnapshot format.\n\nChanges:\n- Add CRITICAL warning: never write state.json directly\n- Document XState snapshot format in RESUME section\n- Update resume instructions to use brain output, not raw state reading\n- Fix troubleshooting to forbid direct writes\n- Fix checklist to use brain orient instead of reading flat fields\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"07e38067fcdf9f95ab0f20beeb74ecb01a508684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/07e38067fcdf9f95ab0f20beeb74ecb01a508684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/31fa7980dc1dc095fe1eda44cbf9ac90ac0b0354","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga