ertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/8d4f7904704b17815b886231bb9e2630d96342ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-09T00:32:14Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-09T00:32:14Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"message":"Add granular state tracking and resume detection to state.json\n\nstate.json previously only tracked 4 coarse phases with no sub-step\ngranularity, and init-project.sh always overwrote it on re-invocation.\nThis made session resumption impossible.\n\nChanges:\n- Add `step` field (17 values) and `team_name` to state.json\n- Add RESUME CHECK at top of Step 0 to detect existing state\n- Add write-state.sh set step calls at every major transition\n- Rewrite RESUME section with step-based jump table\n- Fix sequencing: team_name written after scaffold (not before\n  state.json exists)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7015d51503e450f7dd195a3cc69675767ac28e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/7015d51503e450f7dd195a3cc69675767ac28e3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/8d4f7904704b17815b886231bb9e2630d96342ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/8d4f7904704b17815b886231bb9e2630d96342ce","node_id":"C_kwDORLsQytoAKDhkNGY3OTA0NzA0YjE3ODE1Yjg4NjIzMWJiOWUyNjMwZDk2MzQyY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8","sha":"b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8"}],"sha":"8d4f7904704b17815b886231bb9e2630d96342ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/8d4f7904704b17815b886231bb9e2630d96342ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-09T00:18:27Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-09T00:18:27Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"message":"Override CLAUDE.md executor delegation for Team-based execution\n\nThe Lead was using oh-my-claudecode:executor subagents for BUILD sprints\ninstead of Team teammates (dev-1, dev-2), because CLAUDE.md says \"NEVER\ndo code changes directly - delegate to executor.\" Added explicit override\nstating that in prd-lifecycle, Team teammates ARE the executors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"076c04fc4b030a8aa31192b1154eaf41b13532d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/076c04fc4b030a8aa31192b1154eaf41b13532d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8","node_id":"C_kwDORLsQytoAKGI0NTcxOTgzOTEwMTllZDZmOGJiODFkY2RiNjljNjVmMjFhNDVkZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1","sha":"c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1"}],"sha":"b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/b457198391019ed6f8bb81dcdb69c65f21a45dd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-09T00:00:47Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-09T00:00:47Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"message":"Fix context blowup: read preambles from files instead of inlining\n\nTeammates were hitting context limits and failing to compact because\npreamble content (86-174 lines each) and prior learnings were inlined\ninto spawn prompts. Inlined content becomes part of the initial message\nwhich is non-compactable — it survives compaction and fills the context.\n\nChanged all 25 spawn prompts to instruct teammates to READ their\npreamble and learnings files via tool calls instead. File reads are\ncompactable, so context can be reclaimed when needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f444f77e69399263e763de474cd5e2dc61458138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/f444f77e69399263e763de474cd5e2dc61458138"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1","node_id":"C_kwDORLsQytoAKGMxNThhY2Q2OWQ5NmE2MmU5NzgxOWJlZWJhYWY1YWEzODExNWJiZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commit/827f10a672ece679a57c4d629f0f68a256d317b4","sha":"827f10a672ece679a57c4d629f0f68a256d317b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/827f10a672ece679a57c4d629f0f68a256d317b4"}],"sha":"c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/c158acd69d96a62e97819beebaaf5aa38115bbe1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertobaselga","id":5421854,"login":"albertobaselga","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjE4NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/commits/827f10a672ece679a57c4d629f0f68a256d317b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-08T23:36:07Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T23:36:07Z","email":"alberto.baselga@gmail.com","name":"Alberto Baselga"},"message":"Fix Lead↔teammate communication in SKILL.md\n\nAddresses three critical communication bugs discovered during live testing:\n\n1. Lead name discovery (step 0.3b): After TeamCreate, the Lead now reads\n   the team config to discover its own name and injects it into ALL\n   teammate spawn prompts via RESPONSE PROTOCOL instructions.\n\n2. Idle status anti-pattern: Added CRITICAL warning that teammates going\n   idle (isActive: false) is normal — the Lead must NOT skip waits or\n   invent shortcuts like \"consensus by incorporation.\"\n\n3. Wait mechanism: All 10 wait points now explicitly state that responses\n   arrive as SendMessage conversation turns, not via idle status checks.\n\n4. Peer communication: Pair Review (A.5) and Fix Cycle (B.4) rewritten\n   as Lead-mediated hub-and-spoke — no direct peer-to-peer messaging.\n\n5. Response format: Added RESPONSE FORMAT to 11 message prompts\n   clarifying whether to respond inline via SendMessage or write to file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be4fee00c547def347bb5e852a7d7c87eefcd14e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/trees/be4fee00c547def347bb5e852a7d7c87eefcd14e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertobaselga/prd-lifecycle/git/commits/827f10a672ece679a57c4d629f0f68a256d317b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5421854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertobaselga/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alberto