user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/commits/b2a9f7bd0527157c7782af237150c895bf897b07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:00:47Z","email":"developerinlondon@gmail.com","name":"Nayeem Syed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:00:47Z","email":"developerinlondon@gmail.com","name":"Nayeem Syed"},"message":"docs+ci: GitHub is an issues-only mirror; PRs there close themselves\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md now say where the code lives: deepbrain-oss/assay\non agentgit.org is the primary and GitHub is a push mirror that takes issues.\nA mirror-guard workflow comments and closes any pull request opened on GitHub.\n\nTwo fixes (assay-lua 0.20.8 and 0.20.9) were merged on the GitHub side while\nthe primary sat two commits behind; this branch carries them back so the\nprimary fast-forwards onto the same SHAs.","tree":{"sha":"bbe12c2b8693f950a5612dac722a5468c7c49d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/git/trees/bbe12c2b8693f950a5612dac722a5468c7c49d4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/git/commits/b2a9f7bd0527157c7782af237150c895bf897b07","verification":{"payload":"tree bbe12c2b8693f950a5612dac722a5468c7c49d4a\nparent ef5036b38c567481446be866b3a45fbd4aa254f4\nauthor Nayeem Syed <developerinlondon@gmail.com> 1789437647 +0000\ncommitter Nayeem Syed <developerinlondon@gmail.com> 1789437647 +0000\n\ndocs+ci: GitHub is an issues-only mirror; PRs there close themselves\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md now say where the code lives: deepbrain-oss/assay\non agentgit.org is the primary and GitHub is a push mirror that takes issues.\nA mirror-guard workflow comments and closes any pull request opened on GitHub.\n\nTwo fixes (assay-lua 0.20.8 and 0.20.9) were merged on the GitHub side while\nthe primary sat two commits behind; this branch carries them back so the\nprimary fast-forwards onto the same SHAs.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEG