:{"date":"2026-08-27T02:28:30Z","email":"developerinlondon@gmail.com","name":"Nayeem Syed"},"message":"clickup skill: ship the API''s working knowledge with the module (#32)\n\nAgents kept re-learning the same traps in production: descriptions written\nto the plain field instead of markdown_description, markdown pasted into\nQuill-only comments, a read-modify-write through text_content destroying\nthe formatting it round-tripped, statuses assumed creatable over the API,\nand key-gated work mislabelled blocked when only its live smoke test waits.\nThe skill carries what the API rewards: it is broad — use it fully, and use\nthe right field for each surface.","tree":{"sha":"b64edb6ab72e35a353f45f72867a9b8a7153211d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/git/trees/b64edb6ab72e35a353f45f72867a9b8a7153211d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/git/commits/f7b4e7836ae82f6de15bf2e0629db9f8283fa378","verification":{"payload":"tree b64edb6ab72e35a353f45f72867a9b8a7153211d\nparent 09b03b4d339fdf367da5a428f47424ee326dca1b\nauthor Nayeem Syed <developerinlondon@gmail.com> 1787795138 +0000\ncommitter Nayeem Syed <developerinlondon@gmail.com> 1787797710 +0000\n\nclickup skill: ship the API''s working knowledge with the module (#32)\n\nAgents kept re-learning the same traps in production: descriptions written\nto the plain field instead of markdown_description, markdown pasted into\nQuill-only comments, a read-modify-write through text_content destroying\nthe formatting it round-tripped, statuses assumed creatable over the API,\nand key-gated work mislabelled blocked when only its live smoke test waits.\nThe skill carries what the API rewards: it is broad — use it fully, and use\nthe right field for each surface.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRV/FXDL+YfHsAYcfER+ZP89e7hTAUCao+gzgAKCRAR+ZP89e7h\nTGtRAQDkIkDl784AEXo5EAeJr/J10H3S3rfHhUdmrsWyBBoRkAD8DzGvJXPBo/My\n6pZvR0n5zOAoDpL76ri6K1DIhCmR3w