e no\nsystemd. Fixes pkg_target_host_machine inside rust:1.\n\n.neutron/checks.json pins cargo test --locked with the pg-backed\nintegration cases skipped (they need the CI postgres service) and a\n600s budget - the cold build measured 5m09s at the verifier''s\n4-cpu/8Gi shape.","tree":{"sha":"9c56300f7d6887c02e9d16fd06681289c4eed574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/git/trees/9c56300f7d6887c02e9d16fd06681289c4eed574"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developerinlondon/assay/git/commits/87e87d920e1017d87b745988bacd96258de45ada","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c56300f7d6887c02e9d16fd06681289c4eed574\nparent 502e80f283e9ef6ab12022eb376640c66485c0a4\nauthor Nayeem Syed <smn7818@gmail.com> 1787207533 +0000\ncommitter Nayeem Syed <smn7818@gmail.com> 1787207533 +0000\n\nfix: make the workspace verifiable in a hermetic container\n\nmachine_exec returns a status-127 result table when systemd-run is\nabsent (ENOENT) instead of raising - exec against an unreachable\ntarget contracts to a non-zero status, and containers have no\nsystemd. Fixes pkg_target_host_machine inside rust:1.\n\n.neutron/checks.json pins cargo test --locked with the pg-backed\nintegration cases skipped (they need the CI postgres service) and a\n600s budget - the cold build measured 5m09s at the verifier''s\n4-cpu/8Gi shape.\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRV/FXDL+YfHsAYcfER+ZP89e7hTAUCaoafbQAKCRAR+ZP89e7h\nTF0BAP9HfCjKkuKIPqQeWDHZ5OrhzYgWe9WCpM/eJ+Zzgu2W5AEAgy4HKNbpu1a8\nzbqN1vTee/F0PDKsyhUbXLkFJXWfaQQ=\n=L0BT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185259703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wizardsupreme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wizardsupreme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wizardsupreme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/