/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/fba86430e688ffa4d7ae9cc26f22f441e16f5cd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:00:59Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:00:59Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"message":"feat(mobile): MobileDoc.booked from journalEntryId, not status\n\npending_review rows can already be on the books (auto-categorize, the\nreview route, a failed from-receipt promotion — even $0 drafts) and edits\ndo not repost the journal, so the viewer must lock amount/date/isPersonal\non booked. toMobileDoc derives booked = journalEntryId != null; list and\ndetail rows already carry journalEntryId. Corrects the doc-mapper comment:\nthe auto-categorizer stores raw LLM confidence (0.85-1.0), so AI picks at\n>= 0.95 are labelled categorySource ''user'' (documented limitation).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ea5d97e1b7beb1696990f0ab2a6b63ca61045ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/trees/1ea5d97e1b7beb1696990f0ab2a6b63ca61045ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/commits/fba86430e688ffa4d7ae9cc26f22f441e16f5cd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgD