ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/86ac6f73db887e793588aeedc2868763c0fca4ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:44:14Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:44:14Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"message":"fix(expense): meta.total counts the whole filtered list on every page, not the rows after the cursor\n\nThe count reused the where that includes the keyset clause, so page 2 reported\nfewer rows than page 1. The parser now also returns countWhere (the same\nfilters without the cursor clause) and the route counts that. Legacy callers\nnever send a cursor, so their total is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8cd3f6c5e7f445ae1bb6f761534dcac78ca7e2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/trees/f8cd3f6c5e7f445ae1bb6f761534dcac78ca7e2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/commits/86ac6f73db887e793588aeedc2868763c0fca4ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/86ac6f73db887e793588aeedc2868763c0fca4ef","node_id":"C_kwDORLz5u9oAKDg2YWM2ZjczZGI4ODdlNzkzNTg4YWVlZGMyODY4NzYzYzBmY2E0ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282","sha":"e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282"}],"sha":"86ac6f73db887e793588aeedc2868763c0fca4ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/86ac6f73db887e793588aeedc2868763c0fca4ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:44:04Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:44:04Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"message":"fix(expense): list search treats % and _ literally; cover soft-delete counts and offset+cursor\n\nPrisma hands `contains` text to Postgres ILIKE unescaped, so ?q=% matched every\nrow and ?q=file_name also matched \"fileXname\" (confirmed against a real\nPostgres). escape \\, % and _ before building the filter.\n\nmem-db''s contains/startsWith/endsWith used String.includes, which hid exactly\nthis class of bug; they now follow LIKE semantics (wildcards, backslash escape)\nwith their own test, so the route test fails without the escaping.\n\nAlso adds the review''s coverage gaps: soft-deleted rows stay out of\nmeta.counts, and offset is ignored when a cursor is passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30b308630f5cc317abf62fce3e3e89af8b470e93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/trees/30b308630f5cc317abf62fce3e3e89af8b470e93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/commits/e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282","node_id":"C_kwDORLz5u9oAKGUyNGRlZjM0OTYwMjk5YTU2NWUxMGRlNmZhOWQzNzEwY2Y0MjgyODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/b46c63ae6466bf9ac3b26b0a668987a4d3c800aa","sha":"b46c63ae6466bf9ac3b26b0a668987a4d3c800aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/b46c63ae6466bf9ac3b26b0a668987a4d3c800aa"}],"sha":"e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/e24def34960299a565e10de6fa9d3710cf428282"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/b46c63ae6466bf9ac3b26b0a668987a4d3c800aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:16Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:16Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"message":"fix(expense): from-receipt never strands a claim or leaves a confirmed row off the books\n\n- A claim with no response older than STALE_CLAIM_MS (5 min) is taken over\n  once, via a conditional delete; a recent claim is still 409 in_progress.\n- The bytes OCR call is bounded by OCR_TIMEOUT_MS (25 s); a timeout or any\n  OCR rejection saves a pending_review draft with the receipt stored.\n- Schedule the existing fail-closed idempotency-prune cron daily.\n- Business rows are created pending_review and promoted to confirmed only\n  after backfillExpenseJournalEntry returns an entry; a failed promotion\n  leaves the row in review. Confirmable personal rows are confirmed at birth.\n- OCR amount/tax/tip must be integers within the Int column (shared\n  MAX_AMOUNT_CENTS); non-string vendor/items and non-numeric confidence are\n  treated as unknown instead of crashing or confirming.\n- Replays of a soft-deleted expense answer duplicate:true, deleted:true.\n- Vendor transactionCount is bumped with the expense create, so a retried\n  attempt counts once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"788dcf87207c109993aa6e9bfc540aed5d2e813a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qia