ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/dde9db800d1e2e77cb08be7f7b259afdfa9aad7f","node_id":"C_kwDORLz5u9oAKGRkZTlkYjgwMGQxZTJlNzdjYjA4YmU3ZjdiMjU5YWZkZmE5YWFkN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1","sha":"0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9","sha":"0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9"}],"sha":"dde9db800d1e2e77cb08be7f7b259afdfa9aad7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/dde9db800d1e2e77cb08be7f7b259afdfa9aad7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:16:20Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:16:20Z","email":"103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seanhanca"},"message":"fix(expense): a single uncategorized expense could never be categorized\n\nTwo real, independent bugs, both reported live by a user with exactly one\nexpense stuck as \"Uncategorized\": the category select was disabled, and\nneither manual selection nor chat categorization fixed it.\n\n1. ExpenseList.tsx''s inline \"categorize\" picker sourced its dropdown\n   options from /category-summary — which only lists categories ALREADY\n   used by existing expenses. A tenant with zero categorized expenses gets\n   an empty options list and a permanently disabled select, regardless of\n   how many categories exist in the chart of accounts. Fixed by sourcing\n   options from GET /api/v1/agentbook-core/accounts?type=expense (the\n   tenant''s real chart of accounts) instead. The AI-suggestion review\n   banner''s override dropdown had the identical bug, fixed the same way.\n\n   The accounts route silently ignored its own `type` query param (Budgets\n   Frontpage has passed `?type=expense` since introduction with no effect)\n   — added real server-side filtering.\n\n2. The proactive \"auto-categorize after expense creation\" trigger\n   (checkAndAutoCategorize) existed ONLY in the legacy Express plugin\n   backend. Production resolves /api/v1/agentbook-expense/* through the\n   Next.js route (AGENTBOOK_EXPENSE_URL is unset there), not Express, so\n   that function was dead code — no expense created in production has ever\n   triggered it. Ported into the real production route, calling\n   autoCategorizeForTenant directly (no self-HTTP-fetch / CRON_SECRET\n   round-trip needed — same process). The chat-invoked categorize-expenses\n   skill and the 6-hourly watchdog cron were already correctly wired and\n   are unaffected; this closes the one missing automatic path.\n\nVerified categorize-expenses skill itself (39 existing unit tests, all\npassing) has no single-expense restriction and is well-tested; the gap was\nentirely in wiring, not classification logic.\n\n9 new tests across 3 files, including a source-scan wiring guard for the\nproactive trigger''s call site (the exact class of gap — an adapter/route\nnever actually exercised in prod — that let this ship silently). All\nexisting suites green: agentbook-core backend 1221/1221, agentbook-expense\nfrontend 64/64, apps/web-next 2506/2514 (6 pre-existing, unrelated\nDB-connectivity failures).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54a57a23202f3c682ec0c6518e49cb38f3ab01d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/trees/54a57a23202f3c682ec0c6518e49cb38f3ab01d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/commits/0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103605970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seanhanca","id":103605970,"login":"seanhanca","node_id":"U_kgDOBizm0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanhanca","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9","node_id":"C_kwDORLz5u9oAKDBiYWE3ODZiODc5ZWJkNzg1YjYzYzZlNmNlMzgzNzJhYzI5MmFjZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan/a3p/commit/0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1","sha":"0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1"}],"sha":"0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/0baa786b879ebd785b63c6e6ce38372ac292ace9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1487500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan","id":1487500,"login":"qianghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODc1MDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:38:10Z","email":"qiang.han@gmail.com","name":"qianghan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:38:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(e2e): the phase6b cancel test clears a plan left by phase6 before asserting the nothing-pending line (#574)\n\nCo-authored-by: seanhanca <103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32d5a53b65cb3969c3229d0fc0c305495a40377b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/trees/32d5a53b65cb3969c3229d0fc0c305495a40377b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/commits/0f847cdc60c80e02a41e721f274443a412b5f3e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 32d5a53b65cb3969c3229d0fc0c305495a40377b\nparent 6a9631fdc181dc9da72fb2f692e804255937c216\nauthor qianghan <qiang.han@gmail.com> 1789349890 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789349890 -0700\n\ntest(e2e): the phase6b cancel test clears a plan left by phase6 before asserting the nothing-pending line (#574)\n\nCo-authored-by: seanhanca <103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp1ACCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3e4QAD1EiJ1Jl/y38vxJssjNd1B3\n4niRjXz6FeM/e2NGhdYIK3gNAHmTG1yH2zSrCf3H1xtKQmjsUYVe4wM12EQu3U0P\nHGqen95h5zokeUMefMSgiDduiM0dC9lFRA+r4/9vpvFiwbvayTLyZQrFGOEj+Z81\nr+0qhehzLU+FJ5F77daWPml2xqKbzFefybCtt6W97RpfD2/CFsFPmIhl/7jJvrQu\nFlXmdo8FnRwZW0AVqrgcpDpj39gH3m/93SrgxpWPYh4jWS3/E+uh843NDF5DTg0S\nMkStPtKWZdxdFVbFVQ/C7oCR8F+vAxGnbRHkNkS/VsfpbfKnyd0PoJVppxTyi8ZA\n+C4mMzI6wqGGkUHoNN/nXBOdmAuc0sflZEOXNYIp6FuhLBnw4OOiGUf9gYx2dCJP\nc3yY0MIxPzUbGVGckHgdR02cNXosr3Kofbkb/