ly — a prior answer never licenses a rate\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(chat): when every recent user turn is a bare word, the reply language follows the assistant''s last answer, not the tenant\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: seanhanca <103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpymQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPIQQAJxiKLCy09MQwYDLK0pB5CC6\nB1skGBaV+87AYvU0YM/JWUfyOmR4LdA+chDOh2TiIethAUbjfPJIUIExCO+wm+ch\nZfriDQrtAA70PasRVYE/CEieQB++O+81cDjKCxrqA669KkDuMXBiUmJiLJq25/gN\noxN3q7RG8/3/t1zbbbIj0PEAtQSve46V9PT61GmP4yCERzsbkYWlIIoUnT7aFJmi\nD28Xi/qTTz8TpxqtajcMjBY9qbNBudGDIt13T+zDmKywxSL0swl5UERgKHHTp8aL\nel/uP3JhkMMgpIh16bjMQNwugacygddGetbuw92VRixgJaqSblKGSe+QzLKMvw4y\nqnQWRPLTs5YhrWBhO1OU3907qNCsDFbxLygC8IL56WAbVB8D60nORUg2PqcbaDsK\nPSGruRMlBzEDoOqSGbeOlSwiEaAbFtjkYttPOpOC1ORVSItwoUG+6cs3On9yGKH3\nRpJDeungNVN6it+Yg/DQu8BcUYQ3nOsJ5nilIm/gD+fSEwCCny6bS6UqxViY70px\nN6dfs4Wajjziq8jpmQY5B80Avzkm5YXalfIV4teXKtoVslXXrv8flVo6kFghA9wN\np2ZVSaBFWxBcostME9JkpDp+aI9++Hop5vVrIPmpAswllG7sVQ1Vny7lKBKM90St\n2EIWRUrJBtsLyG5NQe11\n=pN5f\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T22:54:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://ap