dc22e7733b871e909d98b8e4cd3645ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/119427cdc22e7733b871e909d98b8e4cd3645ed9"}],"sha":"f6058c1ad54da8661da690d7d43e1ba2cd281745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/f6058c1ad54da8661da690d7d43e1ba2cd281745"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1487500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qianghan","id":1487500,"login":"qianghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODc1MDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qianghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/commits/119427cdc22e7733b871e909d98b8e4cd3645ed9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T13:44:55Z","email":"qiang.han@gmail.com","name":"qianghan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T13:44:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: stop telling operators to run the services deleted in #517 (#518)\n\nThe runbook''s Production Architecture section described an off-Vercel Docker\nCompose stack running base-svc and plugin-server, and gave three commands\nagainst `docker-compose.production.yml` — a file #517 deleted along with the\nDockerfiles it built. An operator following it would have hit a missing file\nand, worse, believed there was a backend tier to deploy. There is not:\nproduction is Vercel route handlers plus Supabase, and the Express servers\nunder plugins/*/backend are dev-only.\n\nAlso corrected:\n\n  runbook.md         `./bin/db-reset.sh` -> the prisma command it printed\n                     (that script was self-declared DEPRECATED before deletion)\n  TEAMS.md           the two service rows -> route handlers and the CDN bundles\n  database.md        production password advice pointed at the compose file\n  sso-oauth-*.md     a whole \"Backend service (base-svc, hybrid mode)\" section\n                     documenting a second OAuth implementation that no longer\n                     exists — the dangerous kind of stale doc, since someone\n                     would go looking for a copy to keep in sync\n  shell-overview.md  the services/base-svc directory tree\n\nLeft alone deliberately: IMPROVEMENT.md, RELEASE_NOTES_v0.1.0.md and\ndocs/superpowers/plans/*. Those are dated records of work that happened, and\nediting them to match today''s tree would be falsifying history rather than\nfixing a document someone might act on.\n\nCo-authored-by: seanhanca <103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2263b6188745fa5b74760c83219ff736fc4ad2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/trees/2263b6188745fa5b74760c83219ff736fc4ad2a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qianghan/a3p/git/commits/119427cdc22e7733b871e909d98b8e4cd3645ed9","verification":{"payload":"tree 2263b6188745fa5b74760c83219ff736fc4ad2a9\nparent c81e73d7e25d82d90cf2d9d65282837e4df34885\nauthor qianghan <qiang.han@gmail.com> 1788875095 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788875095 -0700\n\ndocs: stop telling operators to run the services deleted in #517 (#518)\n\nThe runbook''s Production Architecture section described an off-Vercel Docker\nCompose stack running base-svc and plugin-server, and gave three commands\nagainst `docker-compose.production.yml` — a file #517 deleted along with the\nDockerfiles it built. An operator following it would have hit a missing file\nand, worse, believed there was a backend tier to deploy. There is not:\nproduction is Vercel route handlers plus Supabase, and the Express servers\nunder plugins/*/backend are dev-only.\n\nAlso corrected:\n\n  runbook.md         `./bin/db-reset.sh` -> the prisma command it printed\n                     (that script was self-declared DEPRECATED before deletion)\n  TEAMS.md           the two service rows -> route handlers and the CDN bundles\n  database.md        production password advice pointed at the compose file\n  sso-oauth-*.md     a whole \"Backend service (base-svc, hybrid mode)\" section\n                     documenting a second OAuth implementation that no longer\n                     exists — the dangerous kind of stale doc, since someone\n                     would go looking for a copy to keep in sync\n  shell-overview.md  the services/base-svc directory tree\n\nLeft alone deliberately: IMPROVEMENT.md, RELEASE_NOTES_v0.1.0.md and\ndocs/superpowers/plans/*. Those are dated records of work that happened, and\nediting them to match today''s tree would be falsifying history rather than\nfixing a document someone might act on.\n\nCo-authored-by: seanhanca <103605970+seanhanca@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBFXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJfgQAIeCAgU/tK6lmgyExKhY8Xeo\na2jJFDKojDOXs4D4QpYmq4cGmxpvl1YSlOQNfHewm/u3YP6kSFZjSk+5c0YvXd0s\npzZbkWnFArFFZYBTKDX9cBZPFAu78IA2tPu8XNuUoDB8kKpzYXmLdWRKwnKZDz0z\noK17puSeP3/Tg6HKy647PgyGOs9Tkd+zt8hHQEtbWj2krGcNkbFe/Ybobpb2LXq+\n4h4uTVbeSMDPzvdCZG9P+CFaTyeY2yyY6UAqnUPQ7ufpgK11AP2CxbkOAQckHNVg\nFcG8PIc0H+a8zHDwmemZcw1DaJoj93xnmMRz/WerOTOf8ZYjwuvoV+JtNSFowcie\nTOx0Op+R5jbS+KDS3iX36Ry2fJNEKuADW/rZx09qAXuNTR0ypRxZbanGMrcV4JiX\nudn1oKlSqcVjK7VKgDNhRo9FfZpjtC8gseYY+VnA0ENkv5/jb7490MprBqdAMhJe\nYJ5HPxaB9